# Core Platform API

**From now on, all live frontend → Core Platform traffic uses this upstream.**

- **OpenAPI / Swagger docs:** https://unifycomply-api.rokxier.com/v1/docs
- **API base URL:** `https://unifycomply-api.rokxier.com` via server-only `API_BASE_URL`
- Local: `.env.local` (gitignored). Example: `.env.example`
- Browser talks only to this app’s BFF (`/api/*`); BFF proxies with `getApiBaseUrl()` in `lib/api/server/upstream.ts`
- Do not use older hosts (e.g. `unifycomply.svr.monolith.ng`)
- Test login: gitignored `.cursor/rules/core-platform-api.local.mdc` — never commit credentials
- **UI first:** if API shape would force UI changes, raise a blocker — see `ui-first-api-integration.mdc`
